  "description": "Our award winning Sentier is much loved for its long, slack modern geometry.\n\nGiving you the feel of total control and confidence, this bike can attack anything in your way. While fully capable to climb the mountain ahead, it comes alive when pointed down a trail. With a nimble and playful character, flow will always be on hand while bossing your way down the trail.\n\nThe Sentier 29 VR’s great spec has you ready for some aggressive trail riding. The Marzocchi Bomber Z2 130mm Boost forks have your back when the trails get rough. Fitted with Shimano MT-501 brakes, SRAM SX Eagle 12 speed drivetrain, finishing kit from Nukeproof and a Brand-X dropper post to adjust your saddle height on the move. Rolling on WTB ST wheels and a Schwalbe Magic Mary / Hans Dampf tubeless ready tyre combo setup you’ll always have the confidence to push the Sentier\n\nSentier 6061 Alloy Boost frame\n\nMarzocchi Bomber Z2 Boost 130mm fork\n\nSRAM SX Eagle 12 speed drivetrain\n\nShimano MT-501 brakes\n\nBrand-X dropper seatpost\n\nSchwalbe Magic Mary / Hans Dampf tyres",
